<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@/~cl_28> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 58 of the principal Act is amended by deleting subsection (3). New section 58a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@/~cl_29> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@/~cl_29> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "29" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@/~cl_29> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@/~cl_29> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 58 the following section: “Appeal to the High Court 58a. (1) Any person, including the Commission, who is aggrieved by the decision of the Competition Appeal Tribunal may, within a period of ninety days from the date the decision of the Competition Appeal Tribunal is served on him, appeal to the High Court. (2) An appeal to the High Court under this section shall be confined to only— (a) questions of law which have arisen in the course of the appeal; or (b) questions as to the amount of the financial penalty. (3) The High Court shall hear and determine any such appeal so referred and may— (a) confirm, reverse or vary the decision of the Competition Appeal Tribunal; and (b) make any such other order as the High Court thinks fit. (4) The provisions of any written law for the time being in force relating to appeal in civil matters from the Sessions Court to the High Court shall apply for the purposes of appeal under this section.”. New sections 64a and 64b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> .
