<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@/~cl_2__para_h> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of “Minister” the following definition: ‘ “premises” means any premises, stationary or otherwise, established or set up by any person, whether such premises is with or without enclosure, and includes a vehicle, aircraft, ship, train and any other means of transport by which persons or goods are carried;’; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> .
