<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@/~cl_31> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 65(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “The Minister may” the words “, on the recommendation of the Commission,”. Amendment of section 66"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/12/eng@> .
